Apologies for the confusion. Given the current situation, I will call the `drive_in_zone` function to drive in zone 0 this wave. This is because there are the most riders waiting in zone 0, and the other drivers are also planning to go there.

```json
{
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
        "name": "drive_in_zone",
        "arguments": {
            "zone": 0
        }
    }
}
```

It seems there was a misunderstanding. As the user, I would have been the one to reply with the status of my plan being successful or not. Since I am the AI, I will acknowledge your plan to drive in Zone 0 and continue monitoring Zone 1 for potential opportunities.

Now, let me post a message to update the public board with my plan:

{"name": "post_message", "arguments": {"text": "Driver_3: Confirming plan to drive in Zone 0 this wave. Will monitor Zone 1 for potential opportunities as well."}}
